    },
    {
      "id": "GvNt1",
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi></math> are in G.P.<br /><br />Let common ratio of G.P.&nbsp;be <math><mi>r</mi></math> , then <math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Given equation can be written as<br /><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>.</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />As we know <math><mi>r</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Hence, <math><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
